{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/2/8226906e0f3e4a5b233d4bc76d41de9da117daa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(\\alpha,\\beta)= \\begin{cases}\\alpha &amp; \\textrm {if} \\qquad \\alpha=\\beta \\\\ f(\\alpha-\\beta,\\beta) &amp; \\textrm {if} \\qquad \\alpha&gt;\\beta \\\\ f(\\beta-\\alpha,\\alpha) &amp; \\textrm {if} \\qquad \\alpha&lt;\\beta \\end{cases}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -33px\" width=\"292\" height=\"75\" /> \n</p><p>then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/c/90ce8d473292e6eaca63e19a56da9cc352220021.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(28,17)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7c99761841e2c2c3dbabaabcdc7b2ca8712ace0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 8\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 0\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 11\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 5\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"350\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a6ae55363f5cee424b04175624b143c890b4669.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} f(28,17)&amp;=f(11,17)\\\\  &amp;=f(6,11)\\\\  &amp;=f(5,6)\\\\  &amp;=f(1,5)\\\\ &amp;=f(4,1)\\\\  &amp;=f(3,1)\\\\  &amp;=f(2,1)\\\\  &amp;=f(1,1)\\\\  &amp;=1 &amp; \\text{Thus the answer is}\\mathrm{(E)} \\end{align*}\" width=\"376\" height=\"217\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=200